# The fixture documents carry non-breaking spaces, ligature glyphs, tabs, trailing
# whitespace and LF line endings on purpose. Every citation in the test suite is an
# exact substring match against them, so any end-of-line conversion or whitespace
# trim breaks the suite silently. Keep them byte for byte.
tests/fixtures/*.txt -text

# The PDF fixtures are laid down byte by byte by scripts/make-pdf-fixtures.mjs and
# the extraction test asserts their text layer character for character. One of them
# is plain ASCII throughout, so git would take it for text and could rewrite its
# line endings on a checkout. Treat them all as bytes.
tests/fixtures/pdf/*.pdf -text -diff
